  m_Name: Worker's Journal 3.1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  line: '06/11/2133


    The boss spoke to me for the first time in a year. All he said was, ''The new age is coming, you must learn the Ham Chant''. So now I''ve got to spend the day memorising it.


    I know I left it around here somewhere.'
